# Used by `npm run dev` (Vite mode "development"). Safe to commit: no secrets here.
# Where the dev server forwards /api requests (the Spring Boot API running on your machine).
VITE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:8081

# Optional "Contact us" overrides (defaults are in src/config.ts; set to an empty value to hide).
# VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=
# VITE_CONTACT_PHONE=
